<title>POLAND: WBK gets PLN 3.2 mln tax relief.</title>
<headline>WBK gets PLN 3.2 mln tax relief.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tax authorities granted Wielkopolski Bank Kredytowy SA a 3.2 million zloty income tax relief for the 1996 fiscal year on the condition that it will take over a branch of Bydgoski Bank Budownictwa SA, WBK said in a statement.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
